  "details": "so i noticed that VR chat has recently added the mute chat box feature when you click on a user you are able to mute there chat box so you cant see what they are typing or have in said chat box it would be nice if you are able to default mute all user chat boxes kind of like how you can turn off voice in the custom safety shield and it will mute the trust ranks you selected by default would that be something that you would be able to implement in a future update maybe to keep the community safer from chat box crashers as well as any harassment from different trust ranks.",
